# Private-team data policy
# Approved processed datasets, shared schemas, reviewed research outputs and
# selected public references are versioned. Raw client/source files under
# data/raw/ stay local and are supplied through the agreed project handover.
data/cache/
data/tmp/
data/external_raw/overture_places/*
!data/external_raw/overture_places/README.md
!data/external_raw/overture_places/*/
data/external_raw/overture_places/*/*
!data/external_raw/overture_places/*/README.md
